# Simulator artefacts from this bench's three elaborations (MODE=card /
# fullgeom / control). `tests/.gitignore` already covers `sim_build_*/`,
# `ucli.key` and the bare `results.xml`, but this bench writes a per-mode
# results file so the three runs cannot overwrite each other's verdict.
results_*.xml
ucli.key
*.log
csrc/
simv*
